              "text": "Where you can order a birthday cake online depends on your location and how quickly you need it. Options are available for quick, local, on-demand deliveries, as well as nationwide shipping from famous bakeries:\n\n---\n\n### 1. In Romania (Local Delivery)\nIf you are located in Romania (specifically in the Bucharest/Ilfov area), there are several excellent bakeries that offer online ordering and delivery:\n*   **Torterie.ro:** A highly convenient option offering a wide range of beautiful birthday cakes with delivery across Bucharest, sometimes even on the same day.\n*   **Cofet\u0103ria Sweet Moments:** Known for natural, high-quality ingredients (like Callebaut Belgian chocolate) and delivery using dedicated refrigerated transport.\n*   **Chocolat:** Premium, high-end cakes and French-style desserts, providing scheduled and safe delivery within Bucharest and Ilfov.\n*   **Cofet\u0103ria Armand:** A fantastic option if you want to order customized cakes, character cakes, or event-specific designs online.\n*   **Cofet\u0103ria Alice:** One of the most famous classic bakeries in Bucharest, offering online ordering for pickup or local delivery.\n*   **On-Demand Apps (Glovo, Bolt Food, Tazz):** If you need a cake delivered within the hour, open any of these local delivery apps, search for \"cake\" or \"cofet\u0103rie,\" and order directly from local bakeries near your address.\n\n---\n\n### 2. In the United States (Nationwide Shipping)\nIf you want to send a cake to someone in the US or are ordering within the country:\n*   **Milk Bar:** Famous for their iconic, unfrost-sided \"Birthday Cake\" and cake truffles. They ship nationwide and the cakes arrive beautifully packaged in insulated cooler boxes.\n*   **Goldbelly:** A massive online gourmet food marketplace. You can use Goldbelly to order legendary cakes from famous bakeries across the country, such as **Magnolia Bakery** (NYC), **We Take The Cake** (Miami), and **Carlos Bakery** (from *Cake Boss* fame).\n*   **Bake Me A Wish!:** This service is specifically designed for birthday gifting. They offer high-quality cakes (like chocolate mousse, red velvet, and cheesecake) delivered overnight nationwide with a personalized greeting card.\n*   **On-Demand Apps (DoorDash, Uber Eats, Grubhub):** For same-day delivery, search these apps for national chains like *The Cheesecake Factory* or local bakeries near the recipient's ZIP code.\n\n---\n\n### 3. In the United Kingdom (Nationwide Shipping)\nIf you are ordering within or to the UK:\n*   **Cutter & Squidge:** Famous for 100% natural, incredibly creative birthday cakes, offering nationwide and London-specific delivery.\n*   **Lola\u2019s Cupcakes:** Offers beautiful, fresh handcrafted cakes with excellent delivery coverage in London and the surrounding areas. \n*   **Patisserie Valerie:** Perfect for traditional, luxurious Belgian chocolate or fruit-themed celebration cakes, offering next-day UK delivery.\n*   **Sponge.co.uk:** Known for their delicious sponge cakes, offering many gluten-free and vegan options with next-day nationwide delivery.\n*   **Deliveroo & Uber Eats:** Perfect for ordering cakes on the same day from local UK cake shops or chains like *Cake Box*.\n\n### Tips for Ordering Online:\n1.  **Lead Time:** If you want a customized design or text written on the cake, try to order at least **48 to 72 hours** in advance. \n2.  **Delivery Format:** Nationwide shipping services (like Goldbelly or Milk Bar) usually ship their cakes frozen in dry ice. Make sure to account for a few hours of thawing time before the party starts!",
